Changed the IP Fabric integration to identify a VLAN by its VLAN ID at a Location rather than by its name, so that a VLAN renamed on the network is synced as an update instead of as a delete and a create. The first sync after upgrading renames any VLAN that Nautobot holds under a different name for the same VLAN ID at the same Location, where previously it would have created a second VLAN and removed or deprecated the first.
